                 mediation formula. However, the mediational g-formula itself
                 can accomodate both mediation and time-varying confounders.",
  series      = "Harvard University Biostatistics Working Paper Series",
  year        =  2014,
  url         = "https://biostats.bepress.com/harvardbiostat/paper168",
  keywords    = "0. Obsidian",
